{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"以赛亚书","commonName":"以赛亚书","title":"以赛亚书","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"632dd4147026fa600518a3f00c24b6fa8a338b17185b54576ae9104ec0242142","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1289},"chapter":{"number":52,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["锡安必获救"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["锡安啊，醒来吧，醒来吧，展示你的能力！",{"text":"圣城耶路撒冷啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"穿上你华美的衣服！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"从今以后，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"未受割礼和不洁净的人必不得再进城。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶路撒冷啊，抖掉身上的灰尘，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"起来，坐到宝座上！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"被掳的少女锡安啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"卸去你颈上的锁链！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["耶和华说：“你们被卖未得分文，你们被赎回也不需分文。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["主耶和华说：“起先我的子民到埃及寄居，后来亚述人无缘无故地欺压他们。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["耶和华说：“如今，我这里还有什么呢？我的子民白白地被掳去，辖制他们的人咆哮大叫，我的名整天被亵渎。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["然而，我的子民终会认识我的名。到那日，他们就会知道是我对他们说的，看啊，是我。”"]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"那穿山越岭之人的脚踪是何等佳美！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他带来佳音，报告平安，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"传递喜讯，宣扬救恩，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"对锡安说：“你的上帝做王了。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"听啊，你的守望者高声呼喊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们在一同欢呼，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为耶和华回到锡安的时候，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们必亲眼看见。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶路撒冷的荒场啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们要一同欢呼歌唱，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为耶和华安慰了祂的子民，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"救赎了耶路撒冷。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华向万国施展祂的圣臂，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"普天下将看见我们上帝的救恩。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"text":"离开吧，离开吧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"离开巴比伦吧！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要沾染不洁之物。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们抬耶和华器具的人啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要从那里出来，保持洁净。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们不用匆忙离开，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也不用奔逃，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为耶和华必走在你们前面，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列的上帝必作你们的后盾。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看啊，我的仆人行事睿智，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必被提升，受到尊崇，升为至高。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"许多人看见祂就诧异，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂的面容毁得不成人样，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂的样貌伤得不成人形。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂必洗净许多国家，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"君王必因祂而闭口无言。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为他们将看见未曾听过的事，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"明白闻所未闻的事。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/52.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/53.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/51.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":15}